WEBVTT

00:01:56.756 --> 00:02:00.076
We still have a broken structure of care.

00:02:00.436 --> 00:02:03.556
And so for me, you know, Girls Who Code,

00:02:03.596 --> 00:02:07.276
I've been spending 10 years telling girls
to like, barnstorm the corner office

00:02:07.316 --> 00:02:10.476
and lean in real hard and you know,
girl-boss their way to the top.

00:02:10.516 --> 00:02:12.636
And so I bought in to that sentiment,

00:02:12.676 --> 00:02:14.236
well, if you just worked harder,

00:02:14.276 --> 00:02:17.316
if you just tried more,
you got a mentor, a sponsor,

00:02:17.356 --> 00:02:19.556
or you learned how
to color-code your calendar,

00:02:19.556 --> 00:02:21.036
like, we would get to equality.

00:02:21.356 --> 00:02:24.876
And the pandemic taught me
that that was all a lie,

00:02:24.916 --> 00:02:26.116
that I had been focused,

00:02:26.156 --> 00:02:29.556
that we had been focused
on the wrong thing,

00:02:29.596 --> 00:02:33.396
and that we actually
have to stop trying to fix women